msgctxt "56_Miki"
msgid "Sir?"
msgstr "¿Jefe...?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "68_Akiyama"
msgid "The manager said something was up. Everything okay?"
msgstr "¿Está todo bien? El gerente me dijo que te pasaba algo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "80_Miki"
msgid "Oh, I don't know..."
msgstr "Eh, yo, bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "92_Akiyama"
msgid "What is it? You can tell me."
msgstr "¿Qué es? Puedes contarme."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "104_Miki"
msgid "You probably didn't know this, but up until recently I had a\\r\nregular named Taniguchi."
msgstr "Quizás no lo sepas, pero hasta hace poco tenía a un cliente habitual llamado Taniguchi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "116_Akiyama"
msgid "Taniguchi?"
msgstr "¿Taniguchi?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "128_Miki"
msgid "That's right. He was kind of a nerdy creep, but he wound up\\r\nspending a lot of money on me."
msgstr "Sí. Era un otaku un poco rarito, pero que había gastado mucho dinero en mí."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "Five million yen..."
msgstr "Unos cinco millones de yenes..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "152_Miki"
msgid "Huh!? So you know about him?"
msgstr "¡¿Eh?! ¿Sabe quién es?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "164_Akiyama"
msgid "No, not really... Anyway, what about this Taniguchi guy?"
msgstr "No, no... Pero dime, ¿qué pasa con ese tal Taniguchi?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "176_Miki"
msgid "Well, he suddenly stopped coming to the club."
msgstr "Es que, de repente, él dejó de venir al club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "188_Miki"
msgid "He never struck me as particularly wealthy, so I just\\r\nfigured he finally ran out of money..."
msgstr "Nunca me dio la impresión de que fuera rico, así que pensé que ya se había quedado sin dinero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "200_Akiyama"
msgid "And now that Taniguchi's not coming around anymore, you're\\r\ntoo devastated to concentrate on work, is that it?"
msgstr "Y ahora que Taniguchi dejó de venir, te sientes sola y no puedes concentrarte en el trabajo, ¿no es así?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "212_Miki"
msgid "Absolutely not! I wouldn't shed any tears over one or two\\r\nfewer nerdy types in here, trust me."
msgstr "¡Por supuesto que no! Jamás me sentiría mal porque uno o dos de esos otakus dejen de venir."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "224_Akiyama"
msgid "So what is it?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿cuál es el problema?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "236_Miki"
msgid "I just saw that dorky Taniguchi walking around looking like\\r\nhe owns the place! It's like he's had a major makeover."
msgstr "¡El otro día, vi a ese otaku apestoso de Taniguchi caminando por ahí haciéndose el importante! Parecía que había cambiado su look por completo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "248_Miki"
msgid "And what's worse, he had another hostess on his arm!"
msgstr "¡Y lo peor es que llevaba a otra hostess agarrada del brazo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "260_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "272_Miki"
msgid "He didn't run out of money after all."
msgstr "Al final, no dejó de venir a la tienda porque se le acabó el dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "284_Miki"
msgid "He changed his image, made himself all cool, then dropped me\\r\nfor some other girl."
msgstr "Cambió su aspecto, se puso bien guapo y me dejó tirada por otra chica de otro club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "...Surely losing one customer doesn't bother you this much?"
msgstr "...Pero perder un solo cliente no es para tanto, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "308_Miki"
msgid "It's a matter of pride!"
msgstr "¡Es una cuestión de orgullo!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "332_Miki"
msgid "It's as though somebody told me I was a good match for only\\r\nthe nerdiest customers. I've lost all faith in myself."
msgstr "Es como si... como si alguien me dijera que solo sirvo para atender a esos otakus. He perdido la confianza en mí misma..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "344_Miki"
msgid "Now that I think about it, a lot of my customers are kind of weird..."
msgstr "Ahora que lo pienso, mucho de mis clientes son raritos..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "356_Akiyama"
msgid "That's not true..."
msgstr "Eso no es cierto..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "368_Miki"
msgid "Fewer and fewer customers ask for me by name. Maybe it's\\r\ntime I leave this job behind..."
msgstr "Cada vez menos y menos clientes me solicitan. Tal vez ya sea el momento de dejar este trabajo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "380_Akiyama"
msgid "I have an idea! Why don't I give you a refresher course in\\r\nhostessing? Help you boost your confidence!"
msgstr "¡Tengo una idea! Para ayudarte a recobrar tu confianza, ¡te daré un entrenamiento especial!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "392_Miki"
msgid "A refresher course?"
msgstr "¿Entrenamiento especial?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "404_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. After all, I'm the one who got you into this mess."
msgstr "Así es, después de todo, fui yo quien te metió en este lío."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "416_Miki"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "428_Akiyama"
msgid "Uh, never mind. Anyway, hostesses need to make their\\r\ncustomers fall for them－hard. You know that, right?"
msgstr "Nada, nada, olvida eso. Como te decía, las hostesses necesitan que sus clientes se enamoren de ellas. Aunque eso ya lo sabes, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "440_Miki"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Síp."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "452_Akiyama"
msgid "From what I've seen, you have no problem entertaining\\r\ncustomers in the club."
msgstr "Por lo que he visto, no tienes ningún problema con entretener a los clientes del club."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "464_Miki"
msgid "Then, what am I missing?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué me hace falta?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "476_Akiyama"
msgid "Are you getting dates after work?"
msgstr "¿Tienes citas después del trabajo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "488_Miki"
msgid "No, not really..."
msgstr "No, en realidad no..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "500_Akiyama"
msgid "There you go. What you need are dates. Consider them\\r\ninsurance, your backup plan."
msgstr "Eso es. Lo que te hace falta es ese empujón final que solo sucede en las citas después del trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "512_Miki"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "524_Akiyama"
msgid "You bet. Dates are different. It's just you and your\\r\ncustomer, one-on-one."
msgstr "Te lo aseguro. Las citas son otra cosa. Estás tú y el cliente a solas. Sin molestias del local."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "536_Akiyama"
msgid "How a hostess acts and the impression she makes at one of\\r\nthese special events have a big effect on her customer."
msgstr "El comportamiento y la impresión que deja una hostess en las citas tienen un gran impacto en el corazón del cliente."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "548_Miki"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "560_Akiyama"
msgid "How about I give you some tips on how to make a customer\\r\nfall head over heels for you?"
msgstr "Ahora déjame encargarme de todo. Te enseñaré unas técnicas para que los clientes se arrodillen ante ti. ¿Te parece bien?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "572_Miki"
msgid "Yes, please!"
msgstr "¡Sí, por favor!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent. Come with me!"
msgstr "Muy bien. ¡Ahora sígueme!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "596_Miki"
msgid "Yes, sir!"
msgstr "¡Sí, señor!"

